{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "I need to flag some significant conditions on the rights side. I reviewed the executed performer agreements yesterday, and they only permit licensing of the documentary in the United States, Canada, and the United Kingdom — not worldwide as the buyer's draft proposes. Additionally, the agreements limit us to a six-month non-exclusive term, not twelve months. Finally, the performer agreements require a written rights amendment before we can proceed to delivery. These are binding constraints we'll need to address before Mara can sign off."}
```

